# sharpness_filter v1/v2: uses obs_source_get_width/height (not base size) for texture_width/height at render time.
source T 1920 1080 1000 500 SRGB video
source P 1920 1080 1920 1080 SRGB video
filter a sharpness_filter 0 @null T P
render a
filter b sharpness_filter 2 @null T P
render b
data d
dset d sharpness dbl 0.75
filter c sharpness_filter 2 d T P
render c
resize T 640 360 3 4
render c
srcspace T SRGB_16F
render c
srcspace T 709_EXTENDED
render c
render a
echo effect load failure: create returns NULL
knob effect_fail 1
filter z sharpness_filter 2 @null T P
knob effect_fail 0
